  "answer": "**MEMORANDUM**\n\n**TO:** PNW Community\n**FROM:** Technical Writing Team\n**DATE:** September 29, 2026\n**SUBJECT:** Final Guide to Paying PNW Parking Citations\n\nThis guide provides the necessary information to resolve parking citations issued at Purdue University Northwest (PNW). Please follow the instructions below to ensure your payment is processed correctly.\n\n**Official Payment Portal**\nFor detailed information on regulations and enforcement, please visit:\nhttps://www.pnw.edu/getting-to-pnw/visiting/parking-and-fees/regulations-and-enforcement/\n\n**Payment Options**\nPayments for parking citations are processed through the Office of Student Accounts.\n\n**What You Will Need**\n*   **Violation Notice**: You will need the hard-copy notice issued at the time of the citation.\n\n**Step-by-Step Instructions**\n1.  **Locate Your Notice**: Retrieve the hard-copy Violation Notice provided with your citation.\n2.  **Verify the Fine**: Review the notice to confirm the violation type and the associated fine amount.\n3.  **Submit Payment**: Coordinate the payment of the fine through the Office of Student Accounts.",
